{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_011_swin_unetr__ssl-title\">Swin UNETR (SSL)</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">3D shifted-window hierarchy 与旋转、重建、对比联合自监督的 Swin UNETR。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">3D shifted-window hierarchical Swin encoder coupled to a U-shaped CNN decoder and pretrained with multi-task 3D self-supervision.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">未标注 3D CT 子体积；微调时输入带标签体数据</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Unlabeled 3D CT sub-volumes for pretraining; labeled 3D volumes for fine-tuning</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">预训练层级编码器及下游 3D 分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pretrained hierarchical 3D Swin encoder and dense downstream volumetric segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Tang_Self-Supervised_Pre-Training_of_Swin_Transformers_for_3D_Medical_Image_Analysis_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Swin UNETR (SSL) original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/81bc1b45af13e496bcce.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D CT Crop</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D CT Crop</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">从体数据采样子体积并构造自监督视图。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests unlabeled 3d ct sub-volumes for pretraining; labeled 3d volumes for fine-tuning and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Crop).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"从体数据采样子体积并构造自监督视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests unlabeled 3d ct sub-volumes for pretraining; labeled 3d volumes for fine-tuning and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Crop).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D CT Crop\" data-node-name-en=\"3D CT Crop\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D CT Crop</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从体数据采样子体积并构造自监督视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests unlabeled 3d ct sub-volumes for pretraining; labeled 3d volumes for fine-tuning and prepares initial tensor representations (3D CT Crop).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将局部体块投影为层级 Transformer 的初始 token 网格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D Patch Embed to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D Patch Embed\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Patch Embed\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Patch Embed</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将局部体块投影为层级 Transformer 的初始 token 网格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D Patch Embed to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在固定 3D 窗口内计算 self-attention，避免全局二次矩阵。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Window MSA within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Window MSA\" data-node-name-en=\"Window MSA\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Window MSA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在固定 3D 窗口内计算 self-attention，避免全局二次矩阵。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Window MSA within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"下一块平移窗口，使信息跨原窗口边界传播。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Shifted Window within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Shifted Window\" data-node-name-en=\"Shifted Window\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Shifted Window</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">下一块平移窗口，使信息跨原窗口边界传播。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Shifted Window within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级减小 D/H/W 并增加通道，形成多尺度体金字塔。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Patch Merging\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch Merging\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch Merging</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级减小 D/H/W 并增加通道，形成多尺度体金字塔。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch Merging within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"联合旋转预测、局部重建/遮挡恢复与对比表示学习。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SSL Heads within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"三类 SSL Heads\" data-node-name-en=\"SSL Heads\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">三类 SSL Heads</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SSL Heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合旋转预测、局部重建/遮挡恢复与对比表示学习。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SSL Heads within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练后的四级体特征作为下游共享编码器。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Swin Encoder within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Swin Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Swin Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Swin Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练后的四级体特征作为下游共享编码器。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Swin Encoder within the core hierarchical 3d transformer ssl computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"卷积上采样并融合各 Swin stage 的 skip 特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies UNETR Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"UNETR Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"UNETR Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>UNETR Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">卷积上采样并融合各 Swin stage 的 skip 特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies UNETR Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"分割头输出体素级类别。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces pretrained hierarchical 3d swin encoder and dense downstream volumetric segmentation via 3D Mask.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"3D Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Mask\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_011_swin_unetr__ssl', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">分割头输出体素级类别。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces pretrained hierarchical 3d swin encoder and dense downstream volumetric segmentation via 3D Mask.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Swin UNETR (SSL) Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Swin UNETR 的三任务三维自监督目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint 3D Masked Inpainting, Rotation, and Contrastive Self-Supervision</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Swin UNETR (SSL)：核心公式 · Swin UNETR 的三任务三维自监督目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"11\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.905281pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.1