5\"></use><use x=\"26.369517\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-97\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"29.598611\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-105\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"31.620429\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-110\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"35.256795\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-116\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"39.997812\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g4-184\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"48.418405\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g10-95\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"54.142936\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g7-50\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"58.778492\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g4-76\" y=\"-62.286445\"></use><use x=\"66.439753\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-99\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"69.668847\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-111\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"73.305212\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-110\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"76.941577\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-116\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"78.963395\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-114\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"81.385216\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-97\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"84.61431\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-115\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use><use x=\"87.334298\" xlink:href=\"#m011_g14-116\" y=\"-60.792065\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">平坦 UNETR token 序列昂贵且缺自然多尺度，3D 标注有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Flat UNETR tokens lack multi-scale spatial pyramids and scale poorly to high-resolution 3D volumes under limited labels.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">层级 shifted-window Transformer 与 U 形解码器结合，并在 5050 个 CT 上自监督预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Replace flat ViT with a 3D shifted-window Swin pyramid and pretrain on 5,050 unlabeled volumetric CT scans.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">窗口注意力、跨窗 shift、层级特征和多任务 3D 预训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">3D W-MSA / SW-MSA window hierarchy, patch merging, and tri-objective 3D SSL (inpainting + rotation + contrastive).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为 MONAI 中重要的 3D Transformer 分割与预训练基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard 3D Transformer segmentation and pretraining baseline within the MONAI ecosystem.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">预训练时有价值；同配方从头训练未必优于现代 CNN</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Valuable when leveraging pretrained weights; from-scratch training under matched recipes does not consistently beat modern 3D CNNs.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">固定窗口把 3D attention 的成本限制在局部 token 集合内。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">shifted windows 与 patch merging 分别解决跨窗通信和层级多尺度。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">先在大量未标注 CT 上联合多个体数据 pretext task，再微调 dense prediction。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Replace flat ViT with a 3D shifted-window Swin pyramid and pretrain on 5,050 unlabeled volumetric CT scans.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: 3D W-MSA / SW-MSA window hierarchy, patch merging, and tri-objective 3D SSL (inpainting + rotation + contrastive).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint 3D Masked Inpainting, Rotation, and Contrastive Self-Supervision.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合利用大量未标注 CT 预训练层级 3D encoder，再迁移到有限标注分割。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">窗口、patch 和预训练 recipe 均是性能来源；从头训练时不能把差异只归因于 Transformer。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Standard 3D Transformer segmentation and pretraining baseline within the MONAI ecosystem.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Valuable when leveraging pretrained weights; from-scratch training under matched recipes does not consistently beat modern 3D CNNs.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Tang_Self-Supervised_Pre-Training_of_Swin_Transformers_for_3D_Medical_Image_Analysis_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Self-Supervised Pre-Training of Swin Transformers for 3D Medical Image Analysis</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Project-MONAI/research-contributions\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L